{
  "_howToEdit": [
    "Each item needs: name, category, description, availability. Everything else is optional.",
    "category must be one of the category ids below: bread, sweets, pierogi, hot, market, holiday.",
    "polish: the Polish name, or leave it out.",
    "photo: a file in images/photos, e.g. images/photos/challah-sm.jpg. Use \"\" for no photo yet; a drawing is shown instead.",
    "price: text exactly as it should appear, e.g. \"$1.65 each\". Use \"\" for no price.",
    "priceConfirmed: false marks a placeholder price. Set showUnconfirmedPrices to false to hide all of them at once.",
    "availability: \"Every day\" or \"Rotating – ask in store\".",
    "Watch the commas: every item ends with a comma except the last one in the list.",
    "availability can also start with \"Preorder\" (e.g. \"Preorder – Thanksgiving\"); those items get a preorder tag.",
    "Hot Food Bar items use group (mains, sides or soups) and days instead of availability: \"daily\", or the days it is usually out, like [\"mon\", \"wed\", \"fri\"]. Days: mon tue wed thu fri sat (we are closed Sundays).",
    "PLACEHOLDER: the days for the mains and salads are samples. Replace them with the real weekly schedule. The soup days are real.",
    "Items with list (loaves, rolls, pastries or cakes) show in the plain lists under the photos: just a name, an optional polish name and an optional price."
